msgid "Loading Trakt ratings"
msgstr "S'estan carregant les valoracions de Trakt"

msgctxt "#32217"
msgid "Watching"
msgstr "Mirant"

msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "El complement Trakt també està activat. Tots dos complements fan scrobble i sincronitzen amb Trakt, de manera que tot es fa dues vegades."

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Mantén-los tots dos"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "Inicia el revisionat"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Voleu iniciar un revisionat a Trakt? El vostre progrés torna a començar i tots els episodis es marquen com a no vistos a Kodi."

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "Revisionat iniciat"

msgctxt "#32223"
